{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36925","headline":"虚白堂前牡丹相传云太傅手植在钱塘 · 罗隐","name":"虚白堂前牡丹相传云太傅手植在钱塘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲询往事奈无言，六十年来托此根。\n香暖几飘袁虎扇，格高常对孔融罇。\n曾忧世乱阴难合，且喜春残色上存。\n莫背阑干便相笑，与君俱受主人恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}